    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call of the Deep (Originally Known as &quot;The Barren Depths&quot;) is a first person survival horror game about plunging to the bottom of the ocean for a paycheck. Heavily inspired by David Szymanski's <strong>IRON LUNG</strong>,  and Zeekerss' <strong>LETHAL COMPANY</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Full singleplayer campaign, featuring 9 unique Levels. <br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Open Levels, able to be explored in any direction. <br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unique but familiar retro art style, mixing old and new techniques. <br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > New enemies and mechanics on every level. <br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A world full of secrets to find. <br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Full voice acting. <br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cryptic but easy to digest storyline. <br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Heavy themes of &quot;Thalassophobia&quot; and &quot;Submechanophobia&quot;  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early in the year 1985, scientists decide to plan their most expensive expedition yet into the area surrounding \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 \u2588\u2588\u2588 reef. The reason for this being that recently, a new species of fish was discovered at the very edge of a steep underwater dropoff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While this would be incredible on its own, this is even stranger since they have ignored \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 \u2588\u2588\u2588 reef for years, because of its reputation. The locals call it &quot;The Barren Waters&quot; as no known life has ever been sighted in the waters. After conducting a S.O.N.A.R scan, the scientists concluded on 9 main areas. Labelled sites 1-9: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the lucky employee who gets to traverse down there! Your goal is to reach site 9, they couldn't scan that far, so it could be anything. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call Of The Deep features gameplay inspired by modern hits like <strong>Lethal Company</strong> and <strong>Content Warning</strong>, but for a singleplayer demographic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day you're dropped in the middle of a new environment, and you must explore and gather photos and video for points. Photograph anything weird and film anything that moves. Between days you can return to the hub and &quot;chill&quot;. Any cool things you pick up will show up in the sub between trips. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When out in the field, you'll meet a plethora of friendly fellows to keep you company! Such as [Redacted as to not cause trauma to past employees]</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get to the bottom of this...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Cover art by Seru.JPG!)</p>",
